# Tracked in dotfiles and symlinked to
#   ~/Library/Application Support/com.cmuxterm.app/config.ghostty
#
# CAVEAT: `cmux themes set` and the in-app theme picker REPLACE this symlink
# with a real file, so their writes escape git. Re-running install.sh
# restores the link (backing up whatever cmux wrote). `cmux themes clear`
# removes the override so ~/.config/ghostty/config takes effect again.
#
# Deliberately empty of settings: appearance lives in dotfiles/ghostty/config.
